[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:The Way to King Street]
[00:00.82]Lesson 73 | 第73课
[00:03.05]The way to King Street | 去国王街的路
[00:06.31]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.91]Why did the man need a phrasebook? | 为什么那个男人需要一本常用语手册？
[00:17.38]Last week Mrs. Mills went to London. | 上周，米尔斯夫人去了伦敦。
[00:23.24]She does not know London very well, and she lost her way. | 她对伦敦不熟悉，迷路了。
[00:30.03]Suddenly, she saw a man near a bus stop. | 突然，她看到一个男人在公交车站附近。
[00:35.47]'I can ask him the way,' she said to herself. | “我可以问他路，”她自言自语道。
[00:41.31]'Excuse me,' she said. | “打扰一下，”她说。
[00:44.58]'Can you tell me the way to King Street, please?' | “请问，你能告诉我国王街怎么走吗？”
[00:50.50]The man smiled pleasantly. | 那个男人友好地笑了笑。
[00:54.36]He did not understand English! | 他不懂英语！
[00:58.33]He spoke German. | 他说德语。
[01:00.79]He was a tourist. | 他是一名游客。
[01:03.72]Then he put his hand into his pocket, and took out a phrasebook. | 然后他把手伸进口袋，掏出了一本常用语手册。
[01:11.63]He opened the book and found a phrase. | 他翻开书，找到了一句话。
[01:16.39]He read the phrase slowly. | 他慢慢地读着这句话。
[01:20.68]'I am sorry,' he said. | “对不起，”他说。
[01:24.67]'I do not speak English.' | “我不会说英语。”